k into our original expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-({x}^{2}+3x+3) & =-({(x+\\frac{3}{2})}^{2}+\\frac{3}{4}) \\\\  & =-{(x+\\frac{3}{2})}^{2}-\\frac{3}{4} \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{4}-{(x+\\frac{3}{2})}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-140337/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2a85fece-e40f-543c-b3c3-ae43a5175808"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-140337"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-140356/selection/226e9bcbdf9597c5033236bec825b7c491d34629662073c195d78fb019402d7c" :answer/id #uuid "765b85c6-7d5e-5e04-abf5-6b7212b03aa0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{4}-{(x+\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140356/selection/59ee6cb89725e83fe222243fef53a1f895e9624664822e2daa937a39985dd28b" :answer/id #uuid "ae740ca3-0d4f-52eb-9f5e-33cbea4dedce" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "32-{(x+10)}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140356/selection/1ed06d318c5a681764328295c5fde72ea2e7441b928d67464eba84c2c5cf087e" :answer/id #uuid "eec7fa9d-f47b-5b99-b266-bc3b5e64deac" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{25}{4}-{(x+\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140356/selection/11d39ab7e0c12c0315ca677b051d963391b2f7ed73b7f23c4015353dabcf5378" :answer/id #uuid "fa55ed30-be75-5007-9a94-c30bd5bb3d87" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{53}{4}-{(x+10)}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140356/selection/54730133a5dfc049d9fc357cfb3a5b0ff1bc482ba42ff20ecab1b130444b3c73" :answer/id #uuid "403fd8f8-b1aa-5e18-b9b5-ecace715b888" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{4}-{(x+\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140356/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "e67a3f81-2262-54af-8e2b-99b7d4a4ea6e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-140356/selection/54730133a5dfc049d9fc357cfb3a5b0ff1bc482ba42ff20ecab1b130444b3c73" :answer-field/choices ["q-140356/selection/226e9bcbdf9597c5033236bec825b7c491d34629662073c195d78fb019402d7c" "q-140356/selection/59ee6cb89725e83fe222243fef53a1f895e9624664822e2daa937a39985dd28b" "q-140356/selection/1ed06d318c5a681764328295c5fde72ea2e7441b928d67464eba84c2c5cf087e" "q-140356/selection/11d39ab7e0c12c0315ca677b051d963391b2f7ed73b7f23c4015353dabcf5378" "q-140356/selection/54730133a5dfc049d9fc357cfb3a5b0ff1bc482ba42ff20ecab1b130444b3c73"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-140356" :question/id #uuid "b0ebb993-ccf9-5c07-9aa5-b4c17d48af4d" :question/math-academy-id "q-140356" :question/problem "Rewrite $-({x}^{2}+5x+7)$ by completing the square." :question/worked-solution "We begin by completing the square for the expression inside the parentheses:\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}+5x+7\n$$\n\nFirst, we rewrite the coefficient of the linear term as a product with $2$ as a factor:\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}+2\\cdot \\frac{5}{2}x+7\n$$\n\nThen, we *add* and *then subtract* ${(\\frac{5}{2})}^{2},$ writing the constant term $7$ last:\n\n$$\n{{x}^{2}+2\\cdot \\frac{5}{2}x+{(\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}}_{⏟}-{(\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}+7\n$$\n\nThe first three terms form a perfect square, which we factor as follows:\n\n$$\n{(x+\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}-{(\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}+7\n$$\n\nEvaluating the last two terms, we get\n\n$$\n{(x+\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}+\\frac{3}{4}.\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute this result back into our original expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-({x}^{2}+5x+7) & =-({(x+\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}+\\frac{3}{4}) \\\\  & =-{(x+\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}-\\frac{3}{4} \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{4}-{(x+\\frac{5}{2})}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-140356/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2a85fece-e40f-543c-b3c3-ae43a5175808"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-140356"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-140528/selection/